[38;5;252m[1m## The one substantive finding[0m[0m
[0m[0m
My first test run was meaningless. [38;5;10mcargo test[0m does [1mnot[22m rebuild a [38;5;10mcrate-type = ["cdylib"][0m artifact, so the suite was [38;5;10mdlopen[0ming a stale [38;5;10m.so[0m from an earlier [38;5;10mcargo build --release[0m. I only caught this because the mutation-testing negative control reported 10 of 12 deliberately-injected bugs as "not caught" — the suite was green regardless of what the source said. Fixed by adding a staleness guard in the harness that compares the [38;5;10m.so[0m mtime against [38;5;10msrc/**/*.rs[0m and aborts, plus a [38;5;10mcargo build[0m before every [38;5;10mcargo test[0m in the driver scripts. Verified the guard fires by touching [38;5;10msrc/lib.rs[0m and watching the suite refuse to run.[0m[0m
